**__attribute__((cmse_nonsecure_entry))**
--
**Focus on return flow:**
+ Prepare the return flow
    - Clean $R0 ~ $R3, $R12 with FNC_RETURN tag
        &gt; Toolchain auto-instert
+ Execute 'bxns' to return to NSPE space
    - CPU hardware flow
        1. CPU changes to Non-Secure state
            &gt; Switch to Non-Secure-Stack (MSP_NS)
        2. Pop the GPRs from Non-Secure-Stack
        3. Put $LR to $PC
